{title: 342 - Is This a Day of New Beginnings?}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #342 • DRONFIELD • 9.8.9.7}
{lyricist: Brian Wren}
{composer: Brian Wren}
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 342}
{meta: tune DRONFIELD}
{meta: meter 9.8.9.7}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Is this [Ab/Eb]a [Bb]day [Bb7]of [Cm]new beginnings,
[Eb]Time to [Ab/Eb]remember [Gm]and [Fm]move [Eb]on,
[Gm]Time [Ab]too [Bb]believe [Ab]what [Db]love [Bb]is [Cm]bringing,
[Gm]Laying [Fm]to [Eb]rest [Ab]the [Gm]pain [Fm]that's [Gm/D]gone?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]How can [Ab/Eb]the [Bb]seasons [Cm]of a [Bb]planet
[Eb]Mindlessly [Bb]spinning [Gm]round [Fm]its [Eb]sun
[Gm]With [Ab]just [Bb]a [Cm]human [Db]name [Bb]and [Cm]number
[Gm]Say [Fm]that [Eb]some [Ab]new [Gm]thing [Fm]has [Gm/D]begun?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Eb]Yet through [Ab/Eb]the [Bb]life [Bb7]and [Cm]death of [Bb]Jesus
[Eb]Love's mighty [Bb]Spirit, [Gm]now [Fm]as [Eb]then,
[Gm]Can [Ab]make [Bb]for [Cm]us [Ab]a [Db]world [Bb]of [Cm]difference
[Gm]As [Fm]faith [Eb]and [Ab]hope [Gm]are [Fm]born [Gm/D]again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Eb]Then let [Ab/Eb]us, [Bb]with [Bb7]the [Cm]Spirit's [Bb]daring,
[Eb]Step from [Ab/Eb]the [Bb]past [Ab]and [Gm]leave [Fm]behind
[Gm]Its [Ab]disappointment, [Db]guilt, [Bb]and [Cm]grieving,
[Gm]Seeking [Eb]new [Ab]paths, [Gm]and [Fm]sure [Gm/D]to [Eb]find.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
[Eb]Christ is [Ab/Eb]alive, [Bb7]and [Cm]goes before [Gm]us
[Eb]To show [Ab/Eb]and [Bb]share [Ab]what [Gm]love [Fm]can [Eb]do.
[Gm]This [Ab]is [Bb]a [Cm]day [Ab]of [Db]new [Bb]beginnings;
[Gm]Our [Fm]God [Eb]is [Ab]making [Fm]all [Gm/D]things [Eb]new.
{end_of_verse}
